  <h1>Privacy Policy for Clankpit</h1>
  <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> November 22, 2026</p>
  <p><strong>Oort Labs</strong> ("we," "our," or "us") built the mobile game <strong>Clankpit</strong> as a free-to-play game supported by advertisements and optional in-app purchases. This Privacy Policy explains how information is collected, used, and shared when you play Clankpit.</p>

  <h2>1. Information We Collect and Third-Party Services</h2>
  <p>We do not require you to create an account or directly submit personal information such as your name or home address to play Clankpit. Game progress is stored locally on your device.</p>
  <p>However, Clankpit uses trusted third-party services that may automatically collect device and usage data to provide ads, process purchases, and maintain app stability:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Google AdMob:</strong> Used to display advertisements. AdMob may collect your device's Advertising ID, IP-derived approximate location, app interaction data, and crash/performance diagnostics to serve and measure ads.</li>
    <li><strong>Google Play Billing:</strong> Used to process optional in-app purchases. Payment details are handled securely by Google Play; we only receive purchase confirmation tokens and order IDs.</li>
    <li><strong>Google Play Services:</strong> Used for core app distribution, licensing, and basic diagnostics.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. How Information Is Used</h2>
  <p>Data collected through these third-party SDKs is used strictly for:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Delivering and measuring in-game advertisements.</li>
    <li>Processing and verifying optional in-app purchases.</li>
    <li>Detecting crashes, preventing fraud, and improving game performance.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Data Retention and Your Choices</h2>
  <p>You can reset or limit personalized advertising at any time through your Android device settings under <strong>Settings &gt; Google &gt; Ads</strong> (or <strong>Privacy &gt; Ads</strong>). Uninstalling Clankpit removes locally stored game save data from your device.</p>

  <h2>4. Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>Clankpit is not directed to children under the age of 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

  <h2>5. Contact Us</h2>
  <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact <strong>Oort Labs</strong> at: <a href="mailto:oortlabsgames@gmail.com">oortlabsgames@gmail.com</a></p>
